    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Metanephric adenoma",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "The neoplasm is unencapsulated and directly abuts the native kidney to the right. The neoplasm is composed of cuboidal cells with primitive basophilic nuclei and minimal cytoplasm, forming small tubules. Mitotic activity is not evident.",
    "source": "Pedram Argani",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "",
    "imageUrl": "https://tumourclassification.iarc.who.int/static/dzi/36/48/21444.jpg",
