    "title": "",
    "legend": "Metanephric adenomas with more prominent papillary areas can be confused with low-grade papillary renal cell carcinoma. The more hyperchromatic nuclei and lack of stromal foam cells are clues to the diagnosis of metanephric adenoma.",
